OL,3,A'I kept seeing people who'd been shot':
OL,4,ABritish tourist describes scene after
OL,5,Adeadly Krakow attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FKrakow's market square remains
OL,8,Fpartially closed a day after six people
OL,9,Fwere killed in a shooting - here's what
OL,10,Fwe know
OL,12,FOf the 16 others injured in the attack,
OL,13,F15 are now stable including two police
OL,14,Fofficers who have emerged from comas -
OL,15,Fthe suspect remains in critical
OL,16,Fcondition
OL,18,FThree more bodies were found at the
OL,19,Fsuspect's home, and were later
OL,20,Fidentified as the man's parents and
OL,21,Fsister
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
