OL,3,A'I kept seeing people who'd been shot':
OL,4,ABritish tourist describes scene after
OL,5,Adeadly Krakow attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FLate on Saturday, Poland's interior
OL,8,Fminister described the suspect - a
OL,9,FPolish man - as being inspired by
OL,10,F"far-right ideologies"; police said he
OL,11,Fused "military weapons" in the attack
